      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{600bb08cb76d6f78b108fb38|full_name}: Excellent, that's two of us :-) Seriously I was looking at the Group panel and there could easily be \"let members see me\", \"let members join me\" options on a per-group basis. If it turned out to not work for someone or some groups simply uncheck it. The default would be off in any case. There are so many people I know are on, we probably have something in common (enough to chat a bit) and I can't get anywhere near them to say hello.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
